{{PageBanner|Clb l 019 1 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular shonen anime known as '''Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba''' (鬼滅の刃, ''Kimetsu no Yaiba'', '''Blade of Demon Destruction''') was originally held from January 30th, 2026 to February 16th, 2026. The collaboration includes an exclusive Rare Gacha, stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period. The anime is published by [[wikipedia:Shueisha|Shueisha]].

==Event Information==
<poem>
The Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collab event is on now in The Battle Cats!
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from March 13th (11:00am) until March 30th (10:59am)!'''}}
※ If this event is not available, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collab Capsules'''}}
Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collab Capsules are available for a limited time!
Collect units like {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Tanjiro Kamado'''}} and {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Giyu Tomioka'''}}, among other collab-exclusive units!
※ Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules for more info.
※ Each of the collab characters will be available only during this event. Collab units are not guaranteed to drop when using the Rare Capsules.
※ Collab units are only available from Collab Rare Capsules. Tap the Collab Capsule banner at the top of the Rare Capsule menu to access it.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collab Stages'''}}
Become a member of the Demon Slayer Corps and eliminate the demons!
Take on the horde of demons in special collab stages!
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collab event to test your Cats at Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collab stages!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stage: "Final Selection"'''}}
Can you pass the test to become a Demon Slayer at Mt. Fujikasane?!
Reward(s):
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Limited collab unit Tanjiro Cat, and more!'''}}
※ Get a 100% chance of obtaining Tanjiro Cat by using a Treasure Radar!
※ Once you have unlocked Tanjiro Cat, activate it by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stage: "Battle at Mt. Natagumo"'''}}
Encounter Lower Rank demons in the spider-filled mountains!
Reward(s):
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Battle items, XP, and more!'''}}
※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Appearing from Day 4 of the collab: Demon Slaying Missions!'''}}
Starting Day 4 of the collab, limited missions pitting your Cat Army against fearsome Demons will be added throughout the campaign!
Check the in-game Event Calendar for more info!
Reward(s):
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Battle items, XP, and more!'''}}
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from March 16th (11:00am) until March 30th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Appearing from Day 7 of the collab: "Mugen Train"!'''}}
Defeat the dreadful Demon luring its victims to sleep!
Reward(s):
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Battle items, and more!'''}}
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from March 19th (11:00am) until March 30th (10:59am)!'''}}
※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Appearing from Day 11 of the collab: "Akaza Strikes!"'''}}
Challenge the Upper Rank demon Akaza and his Blood Demon Art that grows in strength with each battle!
Reward(s):
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Catfruit (Purple, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Epic), and more!'''}}
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from March 23rd (11:00am) until March 30th (10:59am)!'''}}
※ If you have already cleared this stage a certain number of times, you will have to wait until you can challenge it again.
※ Using a Catamin A will immediately grant another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Catclaw Dojo Collab Stage: "Demon Slayer Elites"'''}}
Face off against a relentless onslaught of Demons in this special collab ranking event appearing in the Catclaw Dojo!
Visit the Catclaw Dojo during this collab event to put your Cats to the test in this Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba collab stage!
※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Thanks for your patience!
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen.
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Your score and ranking will be reset when the event ends.
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Collab Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}
Fulfill limited Missions and collect the limited Special unit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Nezuko Cat'''}} as a login reward!
{{Color|#156082|'''Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Special Missions'''}}
Get Cat Ticket rewards!
{{Color|#196B24|'''Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collab Log-in Stamps (18 total)'''}}
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Reward(s): Special unit Nezuko Cat, Rare Ticket, and more!'''}}

※ Limited Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!
※ Once you have unlocked Nezuko Cat, activate it by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

